{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ri2JMOYxUy1792991844.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>剛過去的周末，加拿大樂壇天王The Weeknd以香港為背景的新歌《Hong Kong》在各大社交媒體「洗版」。歌曲不僅用上大量香港拍攝的畫面，網民形容拍攝風格亦甚具王家衛電影的味道，又稱最撼動人心的一刻，是The Weeknd在曲中直接採樣樂壇天后王菲90年代經典歌曲《季候風》。不少網民留言表示深受感動，重溫舊香港的美好回憶。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/theweeknd/reel/De4k4Z7zlxw/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>按此前往Instagram睇片</strong></a></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"weeknd1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Qa1VWIk7SE1792992097.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/> <p><br/> Instagram片段截圖<br/> </p><br/></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"weeknd3.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265ZMvrUch3O1792991692.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/> <p><br/> Instagram片段截圖<br/> </p><br/></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"weeknd5.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SBWcb8B35A1792991713.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/> <p><br/> Instagram片段截圖<br/> </p><br/></p><p><strong>王家衛風格MV重現舊香港情懷　啟德首唱片段IG破千萬觀看</strong></p><p></p><p>The Weeknd近日正在啟德體育園舉行《After Hours Til Dawn》巡迴演唱會。他在不同歌曲中加入「香港」，不斷稱自己深愛著香港這地方，又形容自己後悔過往的巡迴演唱會沒有加入香港這站，承諾未來每次演唱會亦會巡經香港探探歌迷。<br/><br/>上周六和周日兩場，亦演唱了《Hong Kong》。首場後他在Instagram上載演唱樂曲的演唱會片段，短短兩日已累積超過1,390萬次觀看，超過80萬讚好。</p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"weeknd4.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sB6wgKEYxY1792991755.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/> <p><br/> Instagram片段截圖<br/> </p><br/></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"weeknd2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cnmeaRRv9B1792991212.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/> <p><br/> MV上載短短兩天，已有超過80萬人讚好<br/> </p><br/></p><p>事實上，The Weeknd本人一直熱愛香港文化和王家衛電影。他抵達香港開騷前，更獲影帝梁朝偉、劉嘉玲夫婦設宴親自招待。The Weeknd上載合照時，亦特地配上王菲主唱的《夢中人》作為背景音樂。</p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"6936fa0c-9f23-4dba-a193-d799ceae9462.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026dLOnEp0bL31792991787.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"2c995131-0f8b-4a00-a8c8-7f479ca36efa.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026pMlpWX6Fcm1792991805.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:35.589896+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":587,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:38:09.127907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:17.831673+00:00","content_hash":"bf92cd64936b2cdb5f771145182049654b00fde4df2946033b2ffa4ecb6fcd89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:35.589896+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}